{"id":"a9b51610d87e4919","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-lem-swap.md","title":"Forcing Membership Recursion","display":"lem-swap — Forcing Membership Recursion","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-swap","aliases":["58-lem-swap"],"display":"lem-swap — Forcing Membership Recursion","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-swap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-swap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-swap — Forcing Membership Recursion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md\">../batch09/58-df-p-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"46b2495f214783c3\" href=\"?note=46b2495f214783c3\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,P,\\leq_P,p,\\dot x,\\dot y\\in V\">\\(M,P,\\leq_P,p,\\dot x,\\dot y\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in M\">\\(P\\in M\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in P\">\\(p\\in P\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{M,P}\">\\(\\Vdash_{M,P}\\)</span> are from the cited name and forcing-relation atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}swap}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land p\\in P\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\dot x,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\dot y,P)\n\\to\n\\left[\np\\Vdash_{M,P}(\\dot x\\in\\dot y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_Pp\\to\n\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(s\\leq_Pq\\land\n\\exists\\langle\\dot z,r\\rangle\\in\\dot y\\;\n(s\\leq_Pr\\land s\\Vdash_{M,P}(\\dot x=\\dot z))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}swap}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land p\\in P\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\dot x,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\dot y,P)\n\\to\n\\left[\np\\Vdash_{M,P}(\\dot x\\in\\dot y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_Pp\\to\n\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(s\\leq_Pq\\land\n\\exists\\langle\\dot z,r\\rangle\\in\\dot y\\;\n(s\\leq_Pr\\land s\\Vdash_{M,P}(\\dot x=\\dot z))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the exact membership clause of the cited forcing-relation atom: every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\leq_Pp\">\\(q\\leq_Pp\\)</span> has a strengthening meeting a name pair whose first coordinate is forced equal to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot x\">\\(\\dot x\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The model parameter, poset parameter, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-name typing are all explicit; no undeclared density predicate remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"46b2495f214783c3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,P,\\leq_P,p,\\dot x,\\dot y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PName}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_{M,P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}swap}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\n\\land p\\in P\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\dot x,P)\n\\land\\mathrm{PName}_S(\\dot y,P)\n\\to\n\\left[\np\\Vdash_{M,P}(\\dot x\\in\\dot y)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_Pp\\to\n\\exists s\\in P\\;\\bigl(s\\leq_Pq\\land\n\\exists\\langle\\dot z,r\\rangle\\in\\dot y\\;\n(s\\leq_Pr\\land s\\Vdash_{M,P}(\\dot x=\\dot z))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"q\\leq_Pp","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot x","display":f